OL,3,GNEWSAParents cutting basics at
OL,4,AChristmas, charity warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FChristmas is likely to see families cut
OL,7,Fback on essentials to try and meet the
OL,8,Fexpenses of the festive period, a West
OL,9,FSussex soup kitchen has warned.
OL,11,FKatrina McCormack, chief executive of
OL,12,Fthe Shout Worthing Soup Kitchen, told
OL,13,FBBC Radio Sussex that they are forced
OL,14,Fto limit the amount of support they can
OL,15,Fgive due to high demand at Christmas,
OL,16,Fand make sure their shelves are
OL,17,Fstocked.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
