OL,3,GNEWSAParents cutting basics at
OL,4,AChristmas, charity warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes at the start of a campaign to
OL,7,Fraise thousands for turkey and other
OL,8,FChristmas trimmings for struggling
OL,9,Ffamilies, which the charity says is a
OL,10,F"driving force" for their work in
OL,11,FDecember.
OL,13,FMcCormack said: "We ran an afternoon
OL,14,Ftea with Father Christmas, and last
OL,15,Fyear we had children asking him for
OL,16,Ffood."
